entries.definition_en:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2Sa.20.24; 
 son of: Abda (H5653); also called Adoniram at 1Ki.4.6; 5.14; Hadoram at 2Ch.10.18; 
 § Adoram = "my lord is exalted"
1) an officer of David
2) an officer of Rehoboam

A man of the tribe of Judah living before Israel's Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.2.6; 
 son of: Zerah (H2226I); 
 brother of: Zabdi (H2067), Ethan (H0387H), Heman (H1968H) and Calcol (H3633H) 
 § Dara = "the arm"
 a son of Zerah

A woman living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2Sa.17.25; 
 daughter of: Nahash (H5176I) and Nahash (H5176I)(?); 
 sister of: David (H1732)(?), Eliab (H0446I)(?), Abinadab (H0041I)(?), Shimeah (H8093)(?), Nethanel (H5417H)(?), Raddai (H7288)(?), Ozem (H0684)(?), Zeruiah (H6870)(?), Abigail (H0026H)(?) and Elihu (H0453J)(?); married to Jether (H3500H); 
 mother of: Amasa (H6021)
§ Abigail = "my father is joy"
sister of David

A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.20; 
 son of: Seir (H8165B); 
 brother of: Shobal (H7732), Zibeon (H6649H), Anah (H6034H), Dishon (H1787), Ezer (H0687), Dishan (H1789) and Timna (H8555H); 
 father of: Hori (H2753H), Hemam (H1950) 
 § Lotan = "covering"
 the eldest son of Seir the Horite

A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.2.40; 
 son of: Eleasah (H0501); 
 father of: Shallum (H7967I) 
 § Sisamai = "water crane" or "swallow"
 a descendant of Sheshan in the line of Jerahmeel
